Value Required INTERFACE (\S+)
Value TYPE (\S+)
Value WAVELENGTH (\S+)
Value RX_POWER (\S+)
Value TX_POWER (\S+)
Value STATUS (\S+)

Start
  ^Interface\s+Type\s+Wavelength
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+${TYPE}\s+${WAVELENGTH}\s+${RX_POWER}\s+${TX_POWER}\s+${STATUS}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+${TYPE}\s*$$ -> Record
